<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Is your life a channel of blessing?</l><l>Are you burdened for those that are lost?</l><l>Have you urged upon those who are straying,</l><l>The Savior who died on the cross?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We cannot be channels of blessing</l><l>If our lives are not free from all sin;</l><l>We will barriers be and a hindrance</l><l>To those we are trying to win.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
